					<h2><a href="index.html?p=1133" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Reb Zalman Schachter-Shalomi">Reb Zalman Schachter-Shalomi</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Jul 4th, 2014 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
